      "headroomBeforeBoundary": 1.195125,
      "script": "TapTab on Monad splits restaurant bills, so nobody fronts the money."
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-02",
      "editorialStart": 5,
      "editorialEnd": 21,
      "audioFile": "scene-02.mp3",
      "audioOffset": 0.2,
      "audioStart": 5.2,
      "audioDuration": 10.527313,
      "audioEnd": 15.727313,
      "headroomBeforeBoundary": 5.272687,
      "script": "This fifty-three pound ninety-five table is a clearly labelled local sample. Diners claim whole items or selected shares of wine and starters. Each pound total updates instantly."
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-03",
      "editorialStart": 21,
      "editorialEnd": 35,
      "audioFile": "scene-03.mp3",
      "audioOffset": 0.2,
      "audioStart": 21.2,
      "audioDuration": 8.59425,
      "audioEnd": 29.79425,
      "headroomBeforeBoundary": 5.20575,
      "script": "Only volunteers share the fair remainder. The table votes on the tip, then every diner approves the same split. Any change clears consent."
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-04",
      "editorialStart": 35,
      "editorialEnd": 57,
      "audioFile": "scene-04.mp3",
      "audioOffset": 0.2,
      "audioStart": 35.2,
      "audioDuration": 17.92,
      "audioEnd": 53.12,
      "headroomBeforeBoundary": 3.88,
      "script": "Payment opens only after approval. Each diner funds exactly what they owe, or sponsors somebody else without changing the underlying obligation. If eighteen pounds ninety-one is still missing, settlement stays locked. Once the full fifty-three pounds ninety-five arrives, the venue can be paid."
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-05",
      "editorialStart": 57,
      "editorialEnd": 65,
      "audioFile": "scene-05.mp3",
      "audioOffset": 0.2,
      "audioStart": 57.2,
      "audioDuration": 4.728125,
      "audioEnd": 61.928125,
      "headroomBeforeBoundary": 3.071875,
      "script": "Stage Mode turns the same live table state into a room-readable progress board."
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-06",
      "editorialStart": 65,
      "editorialEnd": 83,
      "audioFile": "scene-06.mp3",
      "audioOffset": 0.2,
      "audioStart": 65.2,
      "audioDuration": 12.852188,
      "audioEnd": 78.052188,
      "headroomBeforeBoundary": 4.947812,
      "script": "The contract protects both outcomes. Exact funding unlocks settlement. Cancellation or expiry pays the venue nothing, and opens refunds to each original contributor, including a sponsor."
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-07",
      "editorialStart": 83,
      "editorialEnd": 105,
      "audioFile": "scene-07.mp3",
      "audioOffset": 0.2,
      "audioStart": 83.2,
      "audioDuration": 20.088125,
      "audioEnd": 103.288125,
      "headroomBeforeBoundary": 1.711875,
      "script": "Now switch from the fifty-three pound ninety-five local sample to live evidence. Bill 2 represents forty-eight pounds fifty on Monad Testnet, with a confirmed creation transaction. Monad turns claims, approvals, sponsored payments and refunds into fast shared state for the whole table, without a central bill keeper."
    },
    {
